            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2007",
            "content": {
                "en": "Wh... what just happened?",
                "zh": "怎……怎么回事？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 650.0,
            "positionY": 289.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e551df73-976c-4d31-969c-8ebc1dc72ada",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2008",
            "content": {
                "en": "(The lights are on, and everything around me looks normal.)",
                "zh": "（灯光是亮着的，周边看起来也没有异样。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1015.0,
            "positionY": 289.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "12c191a5-1eda-4925-9dd7-5b3fed318129",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2009",
            "content": {
                "en": "Was I having a nightmare?",
                "zh": "是我做了噩梦？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1386.0,
            "positionY": 289.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c21573c7-16fe-4fa7-b10f-d1d3a998b828",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2010",
            "content": {
                "en": "(But those faces, and that pain... it all felt so real. I still can't forget it. Was all of that really just a dream?)",
                "zh": "（可那些人的脸，还有那种疼痛……太真实了，我现在都还忘不掉。这难道全部都是梦吗？）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1748.0,
            "positionY": 289.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b0b95a78-492b-422c-ac57-10d5c8b31868",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2011a",
            "content": {
                "en": "I should talk to the people around me first. Right, and before that... I should write down what I remember in my notebook.",
                "zh": "先去跟周围的人聊聊吧，对了，把刚才……把记得的事先写在笔记本上吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
