            "contentId": "ch1_2014",
            "content": {
                "en": "- Click the <color=orange>Quest tab</color> to view the current objective.\n- Click the <color=orange>Event tab</color> to view current event details.",
                "zh": "- 点击<color=orange>任务书</color>签查看当前任务条目。\n - 点击<color=orange>事件书</color>签查看当前事件信息。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5832.0,
            "positionY": 303.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6a0b770e-2ecc-4403-afc2-66729f5e7bd4",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2010a",
            "content": {
                "en": "(And in that brief moment just now, I thought I saw some kind of pattern again.)",
                "zh": "（而且，刚才那一瞬间，我好像又看见了什么图案。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2116.0,
            "positionY": 295.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3ae414b9-2d0f-45a8-83b0-127e26be7bc8",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2010b",
            "content": {
                "en": "(It looked like some sort of ritual marking, or maybe... neatly arranged limbs.)",
                "zh": "（像是某种祭祀用的纹样，又像……被摆放整齐的肢体。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2485.0,
            "positionY": 300.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fb3d782c-e878-434a-8e67-3b8d311e4ea6",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2010c",
            "content": {
                "en": "(No, that's not right. The figure at the center of that pattern... why did it look so much like me?)",
                "zh": "（不，不对。那图案中央的人影……为什么那么像我？）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2843.0,
            "positionY": 303.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1628a4bb-67da-4fce-8feb-43f0858109f0",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2011c",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Did the braided bracelet on my wrist just light up for a second?)",
                "zh": "（手上的编织手环，刚才是不是亮了一下？）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3213.0,
            "positionY": 305.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bb4c5ae7-f3ec-48e1-b319-281a124f527a",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2011d",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Could it be that the charm Mengzhi gave me is actually doing something...?)",
                "zh": "（难道是梦之送我的护身符在起作用……？）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3594.0,
            "positionY": 308.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "97173aa3-4b8e-4871-a919-2622131f8110",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "9bf1f67d-ba62-4b57-a9cc-3ce252972f0f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2011",
            "content": {
                "en": "Calm down. I need to gather information about the current situation first.",
                "zh": "冷静点，必须得先收集关于现状的信息才行。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3962.0,
            "positionY": 311.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
